 be a Burn Out Bonfire , here . If it's not lit, use your torch on it and light it up, so it changes into a Smoldering Bonfire . Start using the wood on the bonfire."}],"href":"#/wiki/The%20Percht%20Queen"},{"creature":"The Unarmored Voidborn","qty":"1","hp":"250,000","exp":"15,000","loc":"The Orc Cult hideout in the Edron Orc Cave .","places":[{"name":"Edron Orc Cave","x":33173,"y":31901,"z":7,"href":"#/wiki/Edron%20Orc%20Cave"}],"href":"#/wiki/The%20Unarmored%20Voidborn"}]}}